  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "Podium-style building with two podium-top courtyards; one level of below-grade parking and one level of podium parking",
      "src": [
        "SRC-000714",
        "SRC-000716"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "About 78 feet tall; six stories plus basement",
      "src": [
        "SRC-000714",
        "SRC-000715"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Replaces a former CVS pharmacy between El Camino Real and the Caltrain tracks",
      "src": [
        "SRC-000714"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Developer page describes construction as five levels of Type III over two levels of Type I.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002514"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City page: replaces a 28,000 sq ft CVS Pharmacy; all-electric building; zoning MU-NB-120; lot size 95,925 sq ft. Amendment put six new units on the 6th-level central roof area and converted some 2-bedroom units to studios and 1-bedrooms.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001255"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Amenities reported at groundbreaking: pool, hot tub, courtyards, clubroom, fitness center, resident lounge, bike room.",
